---
title: "withdrawRaisedCapital (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: check caller is projectAdmin
    q_check_auth --> q_check_stage: authorized
    q_check_auth --> q_revert: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_stage --> q_check_supplied: refund period ended and tokens supplied
    q_check_stage --> q_revert: revert InvalidStage
    q_check_supplied --> q_check_withdrawn: capitalWithdrawn == false
    q_check_supplied --> q_revert: revert AlreadyWithdrawn
    q_check_withdrawn --> q_calc_fees: calculate legion and referrer fees
    q_calc_fees --> q_transfer_fees: transfer legionFee to legionFeeReceiver
    q_transfer_fees --> q_transfer_referrer: transfer referrerFee to referrerAddress
    q_transfer_referrer --> q_transfer_project: transfer remaining capital to projectAdmin
    q_transfer_project --> q_mark_withdrawn: capitalWithdrawn = true
    q_mark_withdrawn --> [*]: emit CapitalWithdrawn
    q_revert --> [*]: revert with error

    note right of q_calc_fees
        INV-001: legionFee = totalAcceptedCapital * legionFeeOnCapitalRaisedBps / 10000
        INV-002: referrerFee = totalAcceptedCapital * referrerFeeOnCapitalRaisedBps / 10000
        INV-003: projectReceives = totalAcceptedCapital - legionFee - referrerFee
        INV-004: sum of all transfers equals totalAcceptedCapital
    end note

    note right of q_check_supplied
        INV-005: capital withdrawal requires tokens to be supplied first
        INV-006: withdrawal can only happen once (capitalWithdrawn flag)
    end note
